00:24:45.100 --> 00:24:45.700
&gt;&gt; GÜNTER: Nein, das war...

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:46.500
&gt;&gt; MURAT: Ja.

00:24:47.100 --> 00:24:48.100
Ja. Den kennen...

00:24:48.100 --> 00:24:48.700
